{"id": "t153-001", "text": "Hannah is pregnant! Due early March. She's been really sick with it, so I should check in on her sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sick", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on her", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t153-002", "text": "Bumped into Noah at the station. His band is playing the Crown on the 14th and he said the soundcheck runs late, so they'll start properly about nine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "band", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing the Crown", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "about nine", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t153-003", "text": "Remind me to ask Kai how his half marathon went. It was on Sunday and he'd been nervous about his knee all month.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Kai how his half marathon went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about his knee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all month"}]}
{"id": "t153-005", "text": "Lunch with Ciara. Her daughter Pooja has a violin recital on Thursday evening, her first proper one, and Ciara is far more nervous than the kid is. The day before, she's taking her to the hall for a run-through so it doesn't feel so strange. Afterwards they're going for pizza. I should text Ciara on Friday to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "violin recital", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "The day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "run-through", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going for pizza", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Ciara", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t153-007", "text": "Arjun's sister Pooja had a little boy on Tuesday, 3.4kg, both doing well. They've called him Rafi. Must send something for the baby.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had a little boy", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing well", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafi", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something for the baby", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t153-008", "text": "Victor says the derby has been called off because of the waterlogged pitch. He's gutted, because he'd bought tickets for his dad's birthday and they'd planned the whole day around it: breakfast in town, the match, then dinner. The club say it'll be rescheduled sometime next month, but his dad's birthday is this Saturday, so he's taking him to the races instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Victor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "races", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t153-009", "text": "Theo's play opens the first week of November. He's playing the lead and says he still doesn't know his lines in act two. Wish him luck that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "playing the lead", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish him luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t153-010", "text": "Owen mentioned that his wife Shira is expecting twins over the summer. They found out at the twelve-week scan last Tuesday and both still seem to be in shock. Shira's been told to rest a lot because of her blood pressure, and Owen is already worrying about the car not being big enough. Must send them something to congratulate them, maybe a voucher for the baby shop.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting twins", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "twelve-week scan", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Tuesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in shock", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "blood pressure", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worrying about the car not being big enough", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send them something to congratulate them", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t153-011", "text": "Rhys is trying out for the county squad. Trials are sometime next week and he's been training every evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trying out for the county squad", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}]}
{"id": "t153-013", "text": "Spoke to Ifeoma on the phone. She's moved into the new flat in Leith and loves it, though the boiler keeps cutting out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved into the new flat in Leith", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "boiler keeps cutting out", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t153-014", "text": "Seo-yeon is running the Berlin marathon next September. She's already got a coach and is doing hill sessions on Wednesdays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin marathon", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "got a coach", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hill sessions", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t153-016", "text": "Coffee with Amy. Her brother Finn has just got into the national youth orchestra, cello. She said he'd love some decent rosin as a present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the national youth orchestra", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cello", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love some decent rosin", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t153-018", "text": "Andre's partner Chris had their baby girl this morning! Her name is Isla. Andre said they'll be home in a day or two.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had their baby girl", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a day or two"}]}
{"id": "t153-023", "text": "Paolo told me that the christening has been cancelled. The priest is ill, and they're going to rebook it for the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Paolo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t153-025", "text": "Eli has an audition for the conservatoire in mid-January. He's practising five hours a day and sounds exhausted. His teacher thinks he has a real chance, but his parents would rather he did law, so there's a lot riding on it for him. He also has a mock audition at school the week before. Ask him how he's coping when I see him at Theo's.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the conservatoire", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in mid-January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "would rather he did law", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock audition at school", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how he's coping", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see him", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t153-026", "text": "Pooja is due in three weeks and is going on maternity leave from Friday. Her team is doing a small send-off at lunch that day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "maternity leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small send-off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "lunch that day", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t153-027", "text": "Alejandro and his wife are flying to Madrid over Christmas so the grandparents can meet the baby for the first time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Madrid", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "r3"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t153-028", "text": "Kai's dog Biscuit had an operation on his leg yesterday. Kai said the vet was pleased, but he's not sleeping much. Text him tomorrow to see how they both are.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t153-029", "text": "Owen wants to meet up for a drink sometime after his exams finish, probably late June.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drink", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exams", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably late June", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t153-030", "text": "Mrs Brennan next door said her grandson is in the school play on Friday. She's very proud. He's playing a sheep.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Brennan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandson", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school play", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "playing a sheep", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t153-031", "text": "Hannah's scan went well. It's a girl! She's keeping it quiet for now but said I could tell Joe.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girl", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t153-032", "text": "Need to buy a present for Asha's baby shower on the 9th. She mentioned the nursery is all green and she still needs a night light.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a present for Asha's baby shower", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby shower", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nursery is all green", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "needs a night light", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t153-033", "text": "Ran into Marta at the market. She's taken up bouldering and goes three times a week now. Her flatmate is the one who got her into it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marta", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t153-035", "text": "Shira told me Owen got the job at the hospital. He starts after New Year, the week after they come back from her parents'.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the hospital", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after New Year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t153-038", "text": "Remind me to send Paolo the photos from the gig. He said he'd lost his phone halfway through the encore.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Paolo the photos from the gig", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Paolo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t153-039", "text": "Victor and Seo-yeon have split up. He seemed okay about it but said he's staying at his brother's for now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Victor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t153-042", "text": "I'm going to Andre's gig on the 18th with Arjun. We're getting food beforehand at the Thai place near the venue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting food", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "beforehand", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t153-043", "text": "Arjun said his wife is expecting again! Due late spring. Their eldest, Maya, has asked for a sister and nothing else.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "late spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Maya", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "asked for a sister", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t153-045", "text": "Nikhil invited me to watch the boat race with his rowing club. It's the first Saturday in April. They do a barbecue at the boathouse afterwards, and his partner Andre is usually in charge of the grill. Nikhil rows in the club's second eight, and they have their own regatta in early May that he is quietly hoping to win. He's been up at five most mornings to train.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikhil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "boat race", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "rowing club", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first Saturday in April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue at the boathouse", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in charge of the grill", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikhil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "rows in the club's second eight", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "regatta", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early May", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "five most mornings"}]}
{"id": "t153-046", "text": "Long call with Ifeoma tonight. She is nineteen weeks pregnant and the morning sickness still hasn't stopped. Her husband is working nights, so she's on her own most evenings with their little one, and she sounded worn out. I said I'd pop round sometime next week with dinner. I should also ask her mum whether she's coming over from Lagos before the due date, which is the end of February. And don't forget to send her that pregnancy yoga video.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ifeoma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "morning sickness", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "working nights", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "most evenings"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little one", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worn out", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her mum whether she's coming over from Lagos before the due date", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "r3", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Lagos", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due date", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of February", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that pregnancy yoga video", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t153-049", "text": "Theo Kowalski, aka Teddy, said the band has got a slot at the festival over the summer. He was buzzing. Ask him for the dates so we can get tickets.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo Kowalski", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teddy", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "slot at the festival", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "buzzing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him for the dates", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t153-051", "text": "Note to self: the race entry closes at the end of the month, and I still haven't paid.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "race entry", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t153-052", "text": "Got a long message from Alejandro. His daughter Lucía was baptised on Sunday at the church where he and Marta got married, and the whole family came over from Seville for it. The baby screamed through the entire ceremony, apparently, and then slept all through the lunch afterwards. They're having a second, smaller party for friends at their house sometime in November, and he wants me to bring the kids. Need to find a christening gift before then, something silver maybe.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucía", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baptised", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marta", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got married", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second, smaller party for friends", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in November", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find a christening gift", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t153-054", "text": "Pedro's football team made the cup final. It's on the 22nd at the community stadium, kick-off at three. He's captain this year and says he can't sleep thinking about it. His wife and their two boys are coming to watch, and the whole squad is going for a curry the night before to calm the nerves. Text him good luck that morning, and ask how it went the next day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cup final", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "three", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "captain", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't sleep thinking about it", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boys", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "curry", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t153-055", "text": "Dinner at Noah's. His wife Amy is due any day now, and they've packed the hospital bag three times. Noah's mum is coming to stay the week before to help.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "any day now", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t153-058", "text": "Eli's brother Aidan and his wife are having a gender reveal on Saturday. I can't go because of the wedding, so I should send a card and something small for the baby.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gender reveal", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card and something small for the baby", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2"}]}
